{"sha": "bafe908f644e0dc458142355f8092c1e1e014cde132f52ed4d13b4967b20b1c4", "body": ["\\begin{solution}{exo:b3:product:12}", "在 $\\intoo01^2$ 上，$\\frac1{1 - xy} = \\sum_{n\\geq0}(xy)^n$，", "各项非负，由托内利定理可逐项积分，", "\\[", "\\iint\\frac{\\dd x\\,\\dd y}{1 - xy}", "= \\sum_{n\\geq0}\\Bigl(\\int_0^1x^n\\dd x\\Bigr)", "\\Bigl(\\int_0^1y^n\\dd y\\Bigr)", "= \\sum_{n\\geq0}\\frac1{(n+1)^2} = \\zeta(2) .", "\\]", "对交错情形，$\\frac1{1 + xy} =", "\\sum_n(-1)^n(xy)^n$ 不是正项级数；但", "\\emph{绝对值}级数的积分为 $\\zeta(2) <", "\\infty$，故富比尼定理（此时可积性已确立）适用：", "$\\iint\\frac{\\dd x\\dd y}{1 + xy} =", "\\sum_n\\frac{(-1)^n}{(n+1)^2}$。级数恒等式为：", "\\[", "\\sum_{n\\geq1}\\frac{(-1)^{n-1}}{n^2}", "= \\sum_{n\\geq1}\\frac1{n^2} - 2\\sum_{k\\geq1}\\frac1{(2k)^2}", "= \\zeta(2) - \\frac{\\zeta(2)}2 = \\frac{\\zeta(2)}2 .", "\\]", "利用 $\\zeta(2) = \\frac{\\pi^2}6$（见\\cref{pb:b3:spectral:1}）：", "两积分分别为 $\\frac{\\pi^2}6$ 与 $\\frac{\\pi^2}{12}$。", "在第一个计算中，托内利定理的正性是整个论证的关键", "--- 无需在交换之前检验可积性；", "在第二个计算中，绝对值级数的正性", "正是\\emph{保证}可积性的依据，使富比尼定理", "得以应用于带符号的级数。", "\\end{solution}", "", "\\begin{solution}{pb:b3:product:1}", "\\textbf{1.} 令 $x = t + \\sqrt t\\,u$（$\\dd x = \\sqrt", "t\\,\\dd u$；当 $x$ 取遍 $\\intoo0\\infty$ 时，$u$ 取遍", "$\\intoo{-\\sqrt t}\\infty$）：", "\\[", "\\Gamma(t{+}1) = \\int_0^\\infty x^t\\eu^{-x}\\dd x", "= t^t\\eu^{-t}\\sqrt t\\int_{-\\sqrt t}^{\\infty}", "\\exp\\Bigl(t\\ln\\Bigl(1 + \\frac u{\\sqrt t}\\Bigr) - \\sqrt", "t\\,u\\Bigr)\\dd u,", "\\]", "由 $x^t = t^t\\exp\\bigl(t\\ln(1 + u/\\sqrt t)\\bigr)$ 与", "$\\eu^{-x} = \\eu^{-t}\\eu^{-\\sqrt tu}$ 即得上式。", "", "\\textbf{2.} 固定 $u$，$t \\to \\infty$ 时：$t\\ln(1 +", "u/\\sqrt t) - \\sqrt tu = t\\bigl(\\frac u{\\sqrt t} -", "\\frac{u^2}{2t} + o(\\frac1t)\\bigr) - \\sqrt tu = -\\frac{u^2}2 +", "o(1)$：$g_t(u) \\to \\eu^{-u^2/2}$。", "", "\\textbf{3.} 设 $\\psi_1(h) = \\varphi(h) + \\frac{h^2}4$，", "定义于 $\\intoc{-1}1$ 上，$\\psi_1(0) = 0$，$\\psi_1'(h) = \\frac1{1+h} -", "1 + \\frac h2 = \\frac{h(h-1)}{2(1+h)}$，此式 $\\geq 0$ 在", "$\\intoc{-1}0$ 上成立，$\\leq 0$ 在 $\\intcc01$ 上成立：$\\psi_1 \\leq 0$，", "即 $\\varphi(h) \\leq -h^2/4$ 在此区间成立。令 $\\psi_2(h) =", "\\varphi(h) + ch$，定义于 $\\intco1\\infty$ 上，$c = 1 - \\ln2$：$\\psi_2(1)", "= \\ln2 - 1 + c = 0$，且 $\\psi_2'(h) = c - \\frac h{1+h} \\leq c -", "\\frac12 < 0$，于是 $\\varphi(h) \\leq -ch$ 对 $h \\geq 1$ 成立。现取 $t", "\\geq 1$，若 $\\abs u \\leq \\sqrt t$，则 $g_t(u) =", "\\eu^{t\\varphi(u/\\sqrt t)} \\leq \\eu^{-t(u/\\sqrt t)^2/4} =", "\\eu^{-u^2/4}$；若 $u \\geq \\sqrt t$，则 $t\\,\\varphi(u/\\sqrt t) \\leq", "-ct\\cdot\\frac u{\\sqrt t} = -c\\sqrt t\\,u \\leq -cu$（因 $t \\geq", "1$），故 $g_t(u) \\leq \\eu^{-cu}$。于是 $g_t \\leq \\eu^{-u^2/4} +", "\\eu^{-cu}\\mathbf 1_{u>0}$，可积，且与 $t \\geq", "1$ 无关。", "", "\\textbf{4.} 由控制收敛定理，$\\int_\\R g_t(u)\\dd u \\to", "\\int_\\R\\eu^{-u^2/2}\\dd u = \\sqrt{2\\pi}$", "（利用\\cref{ex:b3:product:polar}，再作", "尺度变换 $u\\mapsto\\sqrt2\\,u$）。结合第 1 问：", "\\[", "\\Gamma(t + 1) \\sim \\sqrt{2\\pi t}\\;\\Bigl(\\frac", "t\\eu\\Bigr)^t,\\qquad", "n! \\sim \\sqrt{2\\pi n}\\,\\Bigl(\\frac n\\eu\\Bigr)^n .", "\\]", "", "\\textbf{5.} 由\\cref{exo:b3:product:8}，$W_{2n} =", "\\frac\\pi2\\,\\frac{(2n)!}{4^n(n!)^2} =", "\\frac\\pi2\\,4^{-n}\\binom{2n}n$。由斯特林公式：", "\\[", "\\binom{2n}{n} = \\frac{(2n)!}{(n!)^2}", "\\sim \\frac{\\sqrt{4\\pi n}\\,(2n/\\eu)^{2n}}", "{2\\pi n\\,(n/\\eu)^{2n}} = \\frac{4^n}{\\sqrt{\\pi n}} .", "\\]", "于是 $W_{2n} \\sim \\frac12\\sqrt{\\pi/n}$，与", "递推式 $W_n = \\frac{n-1}nW_{n-2}$（该式蕴含 $W_n \\sim", "W_{n-2}$，并结合 $W_nW_{n-1}\\cdot n = \\frac\\pi2$ ---", "经典沃利斯关系 --- 给出 $W_n \\sim", "\\sqrt{\\pi/(2n)}$；两种渐近式相容）。", "", "\\textbf{6.} $\\Gamma(\\frac d2 + 1) \\sim \\sqrt{2\\pi\\frac", "d2}\\,(\\frac d{2\\eu})^{d/2}$，于是", "\\[", "v_d = \\frac{\\pi^{d/2}}{\\Gamma(\\frac d2 + 1)}", "\\sim \\frac{1}{\\sqrt{\\pi d}}\\Bigl(\\frac{2\\pi\\eu}", "d\\Bigr)^{d/2} \\longrightarrow 0", "\\]", "比几何级数更快地趋于零（当 $d > 2\\pi\\eu \\approx 17$ 时，每个因子", "$< 1$ 且逐步减小）。数值上 $v_1 = 2$，$v_2 \\approx", "3.14$，$v_3 \\approx 4.19$，$v_4 \\approx 4.93$，$v_5 \\approx", "5.26$，$v_6 \\approx 5.17$：最大值在 $d = 5$ 处取得。", "", "\\textbf{7.} 取 $k = \\frac n2 + \\frac{s\\sqrt n}2$（整数，", "$n$ 为偶数，$s$ 固定）：对 $2^{-n}\\binom nk =", "2^{-n}\\frac{n!}{k!(n-k)!}$ 取对数，并对三个阶乘", "应用斯特林公式。记 $k = \\frac n2(1 + \\varepsilon)$，$n - k =", "\\frac n2(1 - \\varepsilon)$，其中 $\\varepsilon = s/\\sqrt n$：", "\\[", "\\ln\\Bigl(2^{-n}\\binom nk\\Bigr)", "= -\\frac n2\\bigl[(1{+}\\varepsilon)\\ln(1{+}\\varepsilon) +", "(1{-}\\varepsilon)\\ln(1{-}\\varepsilon)\\bigr]", "+ \\frac12\\ln\\frac{2}{\\pi n(1 - \\varepsilon^2)} + o(1),", "\\]", "方括号内的量为 $\\varepsilon^2 + O(\\varepsilon^4) =", "\\frac{s^2}n + O(n^{-2})$：上式趋于 $-\\frac{s^2}2 +", "\\frac12\\ln\\frac2{\\pi n}$ 误差为 $o(1)$，即", "\\[", "2^{-n}\\binom nk \\sim \\sqrt{\\frac{2}{\\pi", "n}}\\;\\eu^{-s^2/2} :", "\\]", "抛掷硬币所呈现的高斯分布形态，已得到定量刻画 ---", "棣莫弗–拉普拉斯的局部形式，有待在", "\\cref{ch:b3:clt}中加以整体化。", ""]}